    "semantic_summary": "The Editor component acts as the primary orchestrator for the entire editor application interface, managing the lifecycle of the editing environment. It integrates core services like EditorService and EditorSettingsService to handle scene loading, state persistence, and UI coordination. It manages rendering loops, handles user interactions like saving, and coordinates specialized behaviors such as Gizmos and Entity Pickers."
